{"version":1,"content":"<p>針對外媒指北京、莫斯科及華盛頓正致力安排中俄美三國元首在即將舉行的深圳亞太經合組織（APEC）會議期間會晤，中國外交部發言人毛寧今（4 日）在例行記者會上表示，「中方就中俄美元首會晤同相關方保持着溝通。</p><p>」（澎湃新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.355094+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:43:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:58:22.791933+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.629594+00:00","content_hash":"3c08ef05b686dd8eab481436eaa6e7e9362c5d4f67eca108e1164b851fec1968","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}